### Collector Pattern for Cross-File Information

Source: https://github.com/phpstan/phpstan-src/blob/2.2.x/_autodocs/00-index.md

Illustrates the pattern for using collectors to gather cross-file information. Implement `Collector` to gather data in parallel, return it as an array, and process it in a rule for `CollectedDataNode`.

```php
